  "gaps": [
    "Professional Courses block is stated as 54 credits, but only 16 three-credit courses (48 credits) are listed; the remaining 6 professional credits are not identified in the capture.",
    "No catalog year/term is stated for the curriculum (tuition is labeled Fall '26 - Summer '27, but the requirements are not tied to a catalog year).",
    "The credit unit type is not explicitly labeled for the program; 'semester' is inferred from references to 15-week semesters and semester hours.",
    "No residency requirement naming specific courses that must be completed at Champlain is stated; the capture only says CCO accepts up to 90 transfer credits toward a bachelor's degree.",
    "The capture does not state whether a course used for one general education category (e.g., CRIT 220, PHIL 240, COMM 130, COMM 140, MKCM 120) may also satisfy another category or the General Education Elective.",
    "Technology Literacy and Scientific Literacy say 'unless your program requires a specific course,' but the capture does not state whether the Accounting program requires a specific course.",
    "Some professional courses are available only in 15-week terms, but the capture does not identify which ones."
  ],
